                      "value": "!!<*yamlover: $defs: chapter>\nCats\n# The Cats chapter — its own directory chapter. Positional body: prose, the `cat-face.png`\n# image chunk (a sibling file here), and a PlantUML state diagram of a cat's day.\ndescription: Independent roommates with opinions\n- |\n  A cat tolerates your presence on terms it renews daily.\n- *: cat-face.png\n- |\n  Vertical space — shelves, perches, a tall scratching post — keeps a cat content. And a\n  clean litter box is the single most important thing you can offer a cat.\n- |\n  A cat's day cycles through a few well-known states:\n- !!<format: text/x-plantuml> |\n  @startuml\n  [*] --> Aloof\n  Aloof --> Hungry : dinnertime\n  Hungry --> Affectionate : fed\n  Affectionate --> Aloof : had enough\n  Aloof --> Zoomies : 3 a.m.\n  Zoomies --> Aloof : worn out\n  @enduml\n\"cat-face.png\":\n  .yo:\n    thumbnails:\n      [256, 256]: *: .yo: thumbnails: xxh64-be1b2e864457e339-256x256.jpg\n",
